l,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:p025","text":"六年，救衞。桓公卒，子威王因齊立。是歳，故齊康公卒，絶無後，奉邑皆入田氏。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m025-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m025-0011","start":11,"end":15,"surface":"威王因齊","kind":"person","person_id":"lmu_nbm_rzo_AAAAAAABAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m025-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"齊康公","kind":"person","person_id":"zwr_jel_e3l_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m025-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"田氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-064-sima:p002","text":"已而大夫鮑氏、高、國之屬害之，譖於景公。景公退穰苴，苴發疾而死。田乞、田豹之徒由此怨高、國等。其後及田常殺簡公，盡滅高子、國子之族。至常曾孫和，因自立為齊威王，用兵行威，大放穰苴之法，而諸侯朝齊。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-064-sima:m002-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"鮑氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、族稱、泛稱或未定指代；不補姓名或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-064-sima:m002-0007","start":7,"end":12,"surface":"高、國之屬","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、族稱、泛稱或未定指代；不補姓名或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-064-sima:m002-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"wuz_yxe_b9k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-064-sima:m002-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"景公","kind":"person","person_id":"wuz_yxe_b9k","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-064-sima:m002-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":